WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.916 --> 00:00:02.791
[Megatron] I tried to recruit her,

00:00:02.875 --> 00:00:09.375
but there was still too much
Alpha Trion polluting her circuits,

00:00:09.458 --> 00:00:11.125
just like you.

00:00:11.208 --> 00:00:12.750
[Prime yells]

00:00:12.833 --> 00:00:15.750
[echoing clatter]

00:00:15.833 --> 00:00:16.791
[Prime] Huh?

00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:19.416
Do you hear that?

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:22.666
Voices… on the other side of this wall.

00:00:23.666 --> 00:00:25.666
-[banging]
-[Prime] Over here!

00:00:28.333 --> 00:00:29.750
Can anyone hear me?

00:00:31.458 --> 00:00:35.083
[groans] Those aren't voices, you idiot.

00:00:35.166 --> 00:00:38.916
It's the environmental systems rebooting.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:42.000
[pained groaning]

00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:46.375
[Prime] I do not know what atrocities
you have committed to get here,

00:00:47.375 --> 00:00:50.000
but the only way you will leave

00:00:50.083 --> 00:00:51.750
is with my help.

00:00:54.208 --> 00:00:57.416
It is time to set aside our disagreements

00:00:57.500 --> 00:00:59.458
and work together.

00:01:00.208 --> 00:01:01.208
No.

00:01:02.416 --> 00:01:08.458
I would rather die in here
than be carried out by you.

00:01:08.541 --> 00:01:12.583
I will not let you die.

00:01:12.666 --> 00:01:15.083
[labored laughing]

00:01:15.166 --> 00:01:18.625
You are so weak.

00:01:21.291 --> 00:01:25.416
The single best thing
that could happen for you

00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:29.875
and your idealistic crusade

00:01:29.958 --> 00:01:32.958
is for me to die.

00:01:33.041 --> 00:01:35.541
All you have to do

00:01:35.625 --> 00:01:38.083
is not help,

00:01:38.666 --> 00:01:42.041
and you can't even manage that.

00:01:45.666 --> 00:01:49.000
Hmm. You should have killed me back there.

00:01:49.083 --> 00:01:53.458
You could have learned the location
of the Allspark from any Autobot,

00:01:53.541 --> 00:01:56.125
or even Teletraan-1.

00:01:56.208 --> 00:01:59.041
Instead, you let me live.

00:01:59.708 --> 00:02:00.833
Why?

00:02:00.916 --> 00:02:03.250
Because you need me.

00:02:03.333 --> 00:02:04.375
Ha!

00:02:04.458 --> 00:02:09.375
[Prime]
Without me and my "idealistic crusade,"

00:02:09.458 --> 00:02:13.083
you would never have amassed
the power you now wield.

00:02:13.708 --> 00:02:17.000
I gave you exactly what you needed:

00:02:17.083 --> 00:02:20.416
a villain for your Decepticons
to rally against.

00:02:21.333 --> 00:02:23.333
But you still need me,

00:02:23.416 --> 00:02:26.125
perhaps now more than ever.

00:02:26.208 --> 00:02:28.833
So, here is my proposal.

00:02:28.916 --> 00:02:31.208
I will help you out of this,

00:02:31.291 --> 00:02:37.791
then you and I will retrieve the Allspark
and bring it home together.

00:02:37.875 --> 00:02:42.208
After that, we go our separate ways.

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:49.250
This will be painful.

00:02:49.333 --> 00:02:51.416
-[girder squeaks]
-[Megatron pained groaning]

00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:54.833
[guttural pained groaning]

00:02:54.916 --> 00:02:56.833
[yells in agony]

